  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is an issue when using Jetty, or any other webapp container",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "that doesn't physically unpack the war file into the webapps directory",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "on auto-deployment.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The workaround is to manually deploy the war file:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "don't put it in webapps/",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "instead, create a directory under webapps/ called 'fedora'",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "un-jar the fedora.war file inside that directory",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "start fedora and try risearch again",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The problem is, the stylesheet that presents the risearch interface",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "can't be loaded (and this prematurely ends the search attempt) because",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the code that loads it assumes it's on the filesystem.  This is is true",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "for tomcat, which physically unpacks the war file on automatic deployment,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "but not true for other webapp containers.  The solution will be to change",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "org.trippi.server.http.Styler#load(String) to resolve the xsl from",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "classloader.getResourceAsStream.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
