     "body": "<p>Effectively running in jetty requires replacing Jetty's slf4j-to-log4j library with log4j-over-slf4j, and adding the logback implementation JARs to jetty/lib/ext</p>",
     "created": "02/Apr/15 3:39 PM",
     "id": "13868",
     "jsdPublic": true,
